\v 22 \wj Ye worship ye know not what: we know what we worship: for salvation is of the Jews.\wj* 
\v 23 \wj But the hour cometh, and now is, when the true worshippers shall worship the Father in spirit and in truth: for the Father seeketh such to worship him.\wj* 
\v 24 \wj God is a Spirit: and they that worship him must worship him in spirit and in truth.\wj* 
