\v 25 [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 1”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 2”}, \wj I told you, and ye believed not: the works that I do in my Father’s name, they bear witness of me.\wj* 
\v 26 \wj But ye believe not, because ye are not of my sheep, as I said unto you.\wj* 
\v 27 \wj My sheep hear my voice, and I know them, and they follow me:\wj* 
\v 28 \wj And I give unto them eternal life; and they shall never perish, neither shall any man pluck them out of my hand.\wj* 
\v 29 \wj My Father, which gave them me, is greater than all; and no man is able to pluck them out of my Father’s hand.\wj* 
\v 30 \wj I and my Father are one.\wj* 
