\v 35 \wj If he called them gods, unto whom the word of God came, and the scripture cannot be broken;\wj* 
\v 36 \wj Say ye of him, whom the Father hath sanctified, and sent into the world, Thou blasphemest; because I said, I am the Son of God?\wj* 
\v 37 \wj If I do not the works of my Father, believe me not.\wj* 
\v 38 \wj But if I do, though ye believe not me, believe the works: that ye may know, and believe, that the Father is in me, and I in him.\wj* 
