\v 9 [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 2 3”} [answered]{strong=“G611” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Adi\sc*-3S 1”}, \wj Are there not twelve hours in the day? If any man walk in the day, he stumbleth not, because he seeth the light of this world.\wj* 
\v 10 \wj But if a man walk in the night, he stumbleth, because there is no light in him.\wj* 
