\v 36 \wj While ye have light, believe in the light, that ye may be the children of light.\wj* [These things]{strong=“G5023” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Apn\sc* 13”} [spake]{strong=“G2980” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 14”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 15 16”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 17”} [departed]{strong=“G565” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 18”}, [and did hide himself]{strong=“G2928” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Api\sc*-3S 19”} [from]{strong=“G575” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 20”} [them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Gpm\sc* 21”}. 
