\v 44 [Jesus]{strong=“G2424” x-morph=“robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 1”} [cried]{strong=“G2896” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 3”} [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 4”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 5”}, \wj He that believeth on me, believeth not on me, but on him that sent me.\wj* 
\v 45 \wj And he that seeth me seeth him that sent me.\wj* 
\v 46 \wj I am come a light into the world, that whosoever believeth on me should not abide in darkness.\wj* 
\v 47 \wj And if any man hear my words, and believe not, I judge him not: for I came not to judge the world, but to save the world.\wj* 
\v 48 \wj He that rejecteth me, and receiveth not my words, hath one that judgeth him: the word that I have spoken, the same shall judge him in the last day.\wj* 
\v 49 \wj For I have not spoken of myself; but the Father which sent me, he gave me a commandment, what I should say, and what I should speak.\wj* 
\v 50 \wj And I know that his commandment is life everlasting: whatsoever I speak therefore, even as the Father said unto me, so I speak.\wj* 
\c 13
\p 
