\v 13 \wj Ye call me Master and Lord: and ye say well; for so I am.\wj* 
\v 14 \wj If I then, your Lord and Master, have washed your feet; ye also ought to wash one another’s feet.\wj* 
\v 15 \wj For I have given you an example, that ye should do as I have done to you.\wj* 
\v 16 \wj Verily, verily, I say unto you, The servant is not greater than his lord; neither he that is sent greater than he that sent him.\wj* 
\v 17 \wj If ye know these things, happy are ye if ye do them.\wj* 
\p
\v 18 \wj I speak not of you all: I know whom I have chosen: but that the scripture may be fulfilled, He that eateth bread with me hath lifted up his heel against me.\wj* 
\v 19 \wj Now I tell you before it come, that, when it is come to pass, ye may believe that I am he.\wj* 
\v 20 \wj Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that receiveth whomsoever I send receiveth me; and he that receiveth me receiveth him that sent me.\wj* 
\v 21 [When Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 3 4”} [had]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”} [thus]{strong=“G5023” x-morph=“robinson: D-\sc Apn\sc* 1”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Nsm\sc* 2”}, [he was troubled]{strong=“G5015” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Api\sc*-3S 5”} [in spirit]{strong=“G3588 G4151” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Dsn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Dsn\sc* 6 7”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 8”} [testified]{strong=“G3140” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aai\sc*-3S 9”}, [and]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 10”} [said]{strong=“G2036” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3S 11”}, \wj Verily, verily, I say unto you, that one of you shall betray me.\wj* 
